Rāvaṇa in disguise questions fearless Sītā --- Sītā names herself Janaka daughter and Rāma wife --- Sītā recounts Kaikēyī boon and forest exile --- Sītā invites guest to await Rāma with forest fare --- Rāvaṇa declares himself world-terrifying lord --- Rāvaṇa bids Sītā become chief queen in Laṅkā --- Sītā vows devotion to lion-like Rāma --- Sītā warns touching her is seizing fangs fire and poison